## Prerequisites

- [Warpgate CLI](https://github.com/CowDogMoo/warpgate) >= 1.0.0
- Docker (for container builds)
{{- if .IncludeAMI}}
- AWS credentials (for AMI builds)
{{- end}}

## Usage

### Validate

```bash
warpgate validate warpgate.yaml
```

### Build Container

```bash
# Build for current architecture
warpgate build warpgate.yaml

# Build for specific architecture
warpgate build warpgate.yaml --arch amd64

# Build and push to registry
warpgate build warpgate.yaml --push
```
{{- if .IncludeAMI}}

### Build AMI

```bash
warpgate build warpgate.yaml --target ami --region us-east-1
```
{{- end}}

## Configuration

Edit `warpgate.yaml` to customize:
- Base image and version
- Provisioning steps (shell, script, or ansible)
- Target platforms and registries
- Variables

